<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">What the World Needs Now</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Love isnâ€™t the only thing that thereâ€™s just too little of. What the world needs now that Prime's gone is... well, a lot of things. Decades of global war do not a stable planet make.&lt;br /&gt;But Etheria survived. Adora loves Catra, and Hordak is in Bright Moon. The planet is full war victims who have suffered decades of devastating warfare. The planet is also full of war villains, who are alive and well in a landscape that hates them. But everyone has grown so much and come so far, some are practically different people, all living in a totally different world. Now they have to figure out how to build an Etheria they can all stand to share. Now it's time for sympathy and forgiveness, and survivor solidarity. Now they have to grow new from the ashes of the old, and invent the future as they build it.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>AintGonnaHauntItself</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
